# GMS pays this out only against enemies under damage over time, freezing,
# stun, darkness or paralysis. Freezing is the one this game has, so the
# character collects it while they are holding Freeze Stacks and not otherwise
# -- see Freezing Crush. GMS's 10+x% ladder is kept whole: 11% up to 20%.
#
# The condition is binary, as GMS's is. One stack lights it and five light it
# no brighter; what climbs with the pile is Freezing Crush's own pair.
name: "Storm Magic"
skill_order: 7
description:
  "Increases your Final Damage when attacking enemies that are Frozen."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_MAGE
max_level: 10
base { final_dmg_pct_when_frozen: 0.11 }
per_level { final_dmg_pct_when_frozen: 0.01 }
